{%- comment -%}
  Velkrova comparison table.

  Rows are deliberately concrete store commitments (delivery, returns,
  tracking, honest timeframes) rather than subjective claims like
  "premium quality" or "real results". Under the UK CAP Code a comparison
  against unnamed competitors has to be verifiable, and a policy either is
  or is not published on a site. Vague quality claims are the ones that
  get challenged, so they are kept out.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="vk-compare">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="vk-compare__grid">
      <div class="vk-compare__copy">
        <span class="vk-compare__eyebrow">THE VELKROVA DIFFERENCE</span>
        <h2>Made for the ten minutes <em>you actually have</em></h2>
        <p>Salon-grade devices chosen for routines that fit into a normal evening, backed by delivery and returns terms we put in writing. No thresholds to reach, no fine print at checkout, and honest timeframes for how long results really take.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="vk-compare__wrap">
        <table class="vk-compare__table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col"><span class="visually-hidden skip-link">Feature</span></th>
              <th scope="col" class="is-us">Velkrova</th>
              <th scope="col">Others</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Free UK delivery, no minimum spend</th>
              <td class="is-us">{% render 'vk-tick' %}</td>
              <td>{% render 'vk-cross' %}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">30-day returns, not the legal 14</th>
              <td class="is-us">{% render 'vk-tick' %}</td>
              <td>{% render 'vk-cross' %}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Tracked on every single order</th>
              <td class="is-us">{% render 'vk-tick' %}</td>
              <td>{% render 'vk-cross' %}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Honest timeframes for results</th>
              <td class="is-us">{% render 'vk-tick' %}</td>
              <td>{% render 'vk-cross' %}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">Routines built for ten minutes</th>
              <td class="is-us">{% render 'vk-tick' %}</td>
              <td>{% render 'vk-cross' %}</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
